{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2022-07-12 00:01:00', 'title': 'IBM EXPANDS POWER10 SERVER FAMILY TO HELP CLIENTS RESPOND FASTER TO RAPIDLY CHANGING BUSINESS DEMANDS', 'text': "NEW POWER10 SCALE-OUT AND MIDRANGE MODELS EXTEND IBM'S CAPABILITIES TO DELIVER FLEXIBLE AND SECURED INFRASTRUCTURE FOR HYBRID CLOUD ENVIRONMENTS ARMONK, N.Y. , JULY 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- IBM (NYSE: IBM) TODAY ANNOUNCED A SIGNIFICANT EXPANSION OF ITS POWER10 SERVER LINE WITH THE INTRODUCTION OF MID-RANGE AND SCALE-OUT SYSTEMS TO MODERNIZE, PROTECT AND AUTOMATE BUSINESS APPLICATIONS AND IT OPERATIONS."}